[PRODUCE] STEP 1 — Open index.html.

STEP 2 — In the #visit section, replace the plain text with these clickable links:

      <p><a href='tel:+15550142'>+1 555-0142</a></p>
      <p><a href='https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=42+Anvil+Street' target='_blank'>42 Anvil Street — Get directions</a></p>
      <p><a href='mailto:hello@beanforge.cafe'>hello@beanforge.cafe</a></p>

STEP 3 — Style the links. In style.css, add:

      a {
        color: var(--copper);
        text-decoration: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--copper);
      }
      a:hover { background: var(--copper); color: var(--cream); }

STEP 4 — Test on your phone.
  Email yourself the index.html (or open the live page after deploying tomorrow).
  Tap the phone number — your phone's dialer opens.
  Tap the address — Google Maps opens.

